{"seq":3,"slug":"finance-engineering","title":"金融与工程应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-processes/applications/finance-engineering","wordCount":1997,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"金融与工程应用\">金融与工程应用</h1><p>1973 年 Black、Scholes 与 Merton 用随机微分方程算出了期权的&quot;公平价格&quot;，开启了一个万亿美元的衍生品市场，并最终摘得诺贝尔经济学奖；几乎同期，Kalman 滤波把含噪声的随机动力学变成了阿波罗登月与现代导航的核心算法。随机过程理论之所以重要，正因为它在金融与工程两大领域同时落地为可计算、可盈利、可救命的工具。这一篇把本 hub 前面铺设的全部机器——布朗运动、伊藤公式、SDE、鞅、马尔可夫链——汇入真实应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>金融与工程对随机过程的诉求，可以归结为三类问题：<strong>定价</strong>（一个未来现金流随机的合约，今天值多少钱？）、<strong>滤波与估计</strong>（从含噪声的观测里，如何最优地还原系统真实状态？）、<strong>控制与决策</strong>（面对随机演化的系统，如何选择行动使长期收益最优？）。它们分别对应鞅与无套利、状态空间模型、马尔可夫决策过程三套理论。下表给出全景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>领域</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>随机过程工具</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>衍生品定价</td>\n<td>期权值多少</td>\n<td>几何布朗运动 + 伊藤公式</td>\n<td>Black–Scholes、蒙特卡洛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险管理</td>\n<td>损失有多大</td>\n<td>复合泊松、跳跃扩散</td>\n<td>VaR、跳跃模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号处理</td>\n<td>从噪声还原状态</td>\n<td>高斯–马尔可夫状态空间</td>\n<td>Kalman 滤波</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机控制</td>\n<td>最优策略</td>\n<td>马尔可夫决策过程</td>\n<td>动态规划、强化学习</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;随机过程应用&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;金融&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;工程&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;Black-Scholes 定价&lt;br/&gt;几何布朗运动&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;风险管理&lt;br/&gt;跳跃扩散 / VaR&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;伊藤公式 + 无套利&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; G[&quot;Kalman 滤波&lt;br/&gt;状态估计&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; H[&quot;随机控制 / MDP&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I[&quot;预测 + 更新循环&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; J[&quot;强化学习&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"随机过程应用\"] --&gt; B[\"金融\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"工程\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"Black-Scholes 定价&lt;br/&gt;几何布朗运动\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"风险管理&lt;br/&gt;跳跃扩散 / VaR\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"伊藤公式 + 无套利\"]\n  C --&gt; G[\"Kalman 滤波&lt;br/&gt;状态估计\"]\n  C --&gt; H[\"随机控制 / MDP\"]\n  G --&gt; I[\"预测 + 更新循环\"]\n  H --&gt; J[\"强化学习\"]</pre><h2 id=\"black-scholes-期权定价\">Black–Scholes 期权定价</h2><p>Black–Scholes 模型假设标的股价服从<a href=\"sde\">几何布朗运动</a>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>σ</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS_t = \\mu S_t\\,dt + \\sigma S_t\\,dB_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。核心洞察是<strong>无套利复制</strong>：用股票与无风险债券构造一个动态调整的投资组合，使其收益在任意瞬间都与期权完全相同——既然两者收益一致，价格就必须相等，否则存在无风险套利。</p>\n<p>对组合价值应用 <a href=\"../martingale-brownian/ito-calculus\">随机积分与伊藤公式</a>，神奇的事情发生了：通过持续调整持仓（即&quot;对冲&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 份股票），可以让组合中的随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dB_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 完全抵消，剩下纯确定性的演化。由此推出期权价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(t, S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 必须满足 <strong>Black–Scholes 偏微分方程</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>S</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial_t V + \\frac{1}{2}\\sigma^2 S^2 \\partial_{SS} V + r S\\, \\partial_S V - rV = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意原始漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 消失了，只剩无风险利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>——这是<strong>风险中性定价</strong>的精髓：在等价鞅测度下，期权价格等于未来收益贴现的期望。求解此 PDE（配欧式看涨期权边界条件）得到著名的 Black–Scholes 闭式公式。其背后的鞅测度变换，正是 <a href=\"../martingale-brownian/martingales-stopping\">鞅与停时</a> 思想在金融中的化身：贴现后的资产价格在风险中性测度下是鞅。</p>\n<p>现实中股价并不严格服从对数正态分布——市场存在&quot;波动率微笑&quot;、价格会跳跃。因此从业者在基础模型上叠加 <a href=\"../foundations/poisson-counting\">泊松过程</a> 驱动的跳跃（Merton 跳跃扩散）、随机波动率（Heston 模型）等。无闭式解时，则用基于 <a href=\"sde\">随机微分方程</a> 数值格式的蒙特卡洛模拟为路径依赖型衍生品（亚式、障碍期权）定价，至今是量化交易台的日常工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kalman-滤波与状态估计\">Kalman 滤波与状态估计</h2><p>工程侧最广泛的随机过程应用是 <strong>Kalman 滤波</strong>。它处理一类<strong>状态空间模型</strong>：系统真实状态按线性高斯动力学演化（一个高斯–马尔可夫过程），但只能通过含噪声的观测间接看到它。目标是在每个时刻给出状态的最优（最小均方误差）估计。</p>\n<p>Kalman 滤波以&quot;预测—更新&quot;两步循环递归运行：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>预测</strong>：用状态转移模型把上一时刻的估计向前推一步，同时让不确定性（协方差）增大；</li>\n<li><strong>更新</strong>：拿到新观测后，按观测的可信度（由噪声协方差决定）加权修正预测，不确定性随之减小。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>它的优雅在于：在线性高斯假设下，Kalman 滤波给出的是严格意义上的最优估计，且全程只需维护均值与协方差两个量，计算极轻，适合实时嵌入式系统。它本质上是 <a href=\"../foundations/stationarity-ergodicity\">平稳性与遍历性</a> 中二阶（高斯）理论的递归实现。面对非线性系统，工程上推广出扩展 Kalman 滤波（EKF）、无迹 Kalman 滤波（UKF）与粒子滤波。从 GPS 导航、自动驾驶的传感器融合，到 SLAM 与机器人定位，Kalman 家族至今是状态估计的主力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随机控制与强化学习\">随机控制与强化学习</h2><p>当我们不只想估计、还想<strong>决策</strong>时，问题升级为随机控制。<strong>马尔可夫决策过程</strong>（MDP）在 <a href=\"../markov/markov-chains\">马尔可夫链</a> 之上加入动作与奖励：每一步根据当前状态选择动作，动作影响下一状态的转移概率并带来即时奖励，目标是最大化长期累积奖励的期望。它的求解依赖 Bellman 最优方程与动态规划。</p>\n<p>当转移概率未知、只能通过与环境交互试错学习时，MDP 就成了<strong>强化学习</strong>（reinforcement learning）的数学框架。Q-learning、策略梯度、Actor–Critic 等算法，本质都是在 MDP 上做随机逼近——而随机逼近的收敛性证明，又回到 <a href=\"../martingale-brownian/martingales-stopping\">鞅与停时</a> 的鞅收敛定理。2026 年驱动大语言模型对齐的 RLHF、以及机器人与博弈智能体，都建立在这套随机过程理论之上。连续时间版本则是随机最优控制（Hamilton–Jacobi–Bellman 方程），与 <a href=\"sde\">随机微分方程</a> 直接耦合，用于金融的最优投资组合（Merton 问题）与工程的最优制导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区与建模要点\">常见误区与建模要点</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>常见误判</th>\n<th>症结</th>\n<th>澄清</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>认为对冲击式定价的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 直接影响期权价</td>\n<td>忽略风险中性</td>\n<td>Black–Scholes 结果中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 消失，价格只依赖波动率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 与利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>以为对数正态就是真实股价</td>\n<td>忽略厚尾与跳跃</td>\n<td>市场存在波动率微笑与价格跳跃，需跳跃扩散或随机波动率修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把 Kalman 滤波用在非线性系统上</td>\n<td>超出线性高斯假设</td>\n<td>非线性需 EKF/UKF/粒子滤波，标准 Kalman 最优性仅在假设内成立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认为 MDP 有解就不必探索</td>\n<td>忽略转移未知</td>\n<td>转移概率未知时须靠试错学习，这正是强化学习与动态规划的分野</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>应用时的共性原则是<strong>先验证模型假设再信任结论</strong>：几何布朗运动的恒正与对数正态、Kalman 的线性高斯、MDP 的马尔可夫性，都是结论成立的前提。工程落地还要关注数值与实现层面——蒙特卡洛的方差缩减、滤波器的协方差数值稳定性、强化学习的探索—利用权衡，往往比理论公式更决定实际效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>金融与工程对随机过程的诉求归结为定价、滤波估计、控制决策三类，分别对应鞅/无套利、状态空间模型、马尔可夫决策过程。</li>\n<li>Black–Scholes 用几何布朗运动 + 伊藤公式 + 无套利复制推出定价 PDE，风险中性定价让漂移消失、价格成为鞅测度下的期望；跳跃扩散与随机波动率是现实修正。</li>\n<li>Kalman 滤波以预测—更新循环给出线性高斯状态空间的最优估计，是二阶理论的递归实现，广泛用于导航与传感器融合。</li>\n<li>马尔可夫决策过程与强化学习把随机控制问题落地，其收敛性依赖鞅收敛定理，支撑现代 RLHF 与机器人决策。</li>\n<li>这一篇把全 hub 的工具——布朗运动、伊藤公式、SDE、鞅、马尔可夫链——汇入真实世界的可计算应用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"金融与工程应用","id":"金融与工程应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Black–Scholes 期权定价","id":"black-scholes-期权定价"},{"level":2,"text":"Kalman 滤波与状态估计","id":"kalman-滤波与状态估计"},{"level":2,"text":"随机控制与强化学习","id":"随机控制与强化学习"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区与建模要点","id":"常见误区与建模要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"随机微分方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-processes/applications/sde"},"next":null}